              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='37859' id='40' type-v2='text' w='19639' x='79622' y='38476'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>The Column</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'> % of Customers with Phone Changes</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'> in the top left table gives the percentage of customers which changed their Phone number out of total poulation.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>The</run>
                  <run>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>% of Customers with Phone Changes </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>is further segregated into the avg. number of days slabs, these percentages are calculated incrementally from left to right in the table.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>The Table on the bottom left gives the % increase or decrease in the slab % from top table wrt to initial date of the analysis.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>The Bottom left table by default calculates the </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>delta for each corresponding KP</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>I on the </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>current date and start of the analysis date or 1st Jan </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>of the current year (whichever Later).</run>
